[1.0728, "o", "\u001b[31mDeployment needs configuration:\r\n  - Add metadata.description, an HTML description, or --description <text> (root).\r\n  - Add relays or pass --relay <ws(s)://url>.\r\n  - Add blossomServers or pass --server <http(s)://origin>.\r\nRun without -i in a terminal for guided setup.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
